mean_alpha_t must be >= alpha - mean_Lambda - telescoping - frac_B_complement - M_T.
The martingale term M_T is of order T^{-1/2} and is omitted here (its omission can only make the
check stricter when it is positive); 'margin' is lhs minus the right-hand side without M_T.
